---
to: "src/mmdio/engine/render_projection.py"
force: true
sparql:
  generic_types: |
    PREFIX mer: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/ontology/mermaid#>
    SELECT ?internalId WHERE { ?type mer:pythonSupport true ; mer:pythonInternalId ?internalId ; mer:renderStrategy "generic" . } ORDER BY ?internalId
---
"""GENERATED DIAGNOSTIC PROJECTION.

Specialized Mermaid renderers remain in src/mmdio/engine/render.py because conditional
syntax, token maps, escaping, and recursion are not representable as fixed row formats.
This file is intentionally empty until a type is admitted with renderStrategy=generic.
"""
GENERIC_RENDER_TYPES = ({% for row in generic_types %}"{{ row.internalId }}",{% endfor %})
